owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-10-16T10:21:40Z","updated_at":"2019-10-16T10:41:01Z","body":"I would say that using createMessage is the right thing for this use case. That works for me when trying this out:\r\n\r\n```\r\nint positionMs = 30_000;\r\nplayer.createMessage((messageType, payload)\r\n         -> Log.d(\"player-message\", payload.toString()))\r\n     .setPosition(positionMs)\r\n     .setPayload(\"payload 1\")\r\n     .send();\r\nplayer.seekTo(positionMs);\r\nplayer.prepare(mediaSource, false, false);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis gives me the output below when using EventLogger:\r\n\r\n```\r\n2019-10-16 11:10:34.183 13528-13528/com.google.android.exoplayer2.demo I/ExoPlayerImpl: Init bfe450d [ExoPlayerLib/2.10.6] [sailfish, Pixel, Google, 28]\r\n2019-10-16 11:10:34.213 13528-13528/com.google.android.exoplayer2.demo D/EventLogger: seekStarted [0.01, 0.00, window=0]\r\n2019-10-16 11:10:34.214 13528-13528/com.google.android.exoplayer2.demo D/EventLogger: positionDiscontinuity [0.01, 30.00, window=0, SEEK]\r\n2019-10-16 11:10:34.218 13528-13528/com.google.android.exoplayer2.demo D/EventLogger: state [0.01, 30.00, window=0, true, BUFFERING]\r\n2019-10-16 11:10:34.253 13528-13739/com.google.android.exoplayer2.demo D/player-message: payload 1\r\n2019-10-16 11:10:34.278 13528-13528/com.google.android.exoplayer2.demo D/EventLogger: surfaceSize [0.07, 30.00, window=0, 1080, 1695]\r\n```\r\n\r\nI seek to the given position and the message is sent once at the correct time. This works as expected for me. \r\n\r\n> even before the video starts playing\r\n\r\nI think it is expected that the message is sent at the moment when the position defined is reached. There is no guarantee that this is only fired when in STATE_READY. So receiving the message while in STATE_BUFFERING sounds ok to me in case you are seeking to this position. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/542634088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"marcbaechinger","id":584321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NDMyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/584321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger","html_url":"https://github.com/marcbaechinger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcbaechinger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2717074395,"node_id":"MDE0OlVubGFiZWxlZEV2ZW50MjcxNzA3NDM5NQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/2717074395","actor":{"login":"marcbaechinger","i